WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Sachin Industries, Pune. A stylised large-format fiber laser machine.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
The cutting head traces a line into metal. 12 kW laser power; cutting up to 40 mm, subject to material and job review.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Bending: a long-format press brake. Up to 25 mm thickness and 8 metre length capability, subject to review.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
The punch descends into a V die, forming the sheet. It retracts and the metal keeps its bent shape.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Shearing: a heavy-duty straight-cutting machine. Headline capacities up to 25 mm and 8 metres.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
A moving blade passes the fixed edge and the separated strip drops away. All animation is illustrative; actual capacities depend on the job.
